OL,3,GNEWSALandmark open to public for first
OL,4,Atime in 40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landmark in the West Midlands has
OL,7,Fopened to the public for the first time
OL,8,Fin about 40 years, as part of a
OL,9,Ffestival celebrating England's
OL,10,Fheritage.
OL,12,FThe Grade II-listed Sedgley Beacon
OL,13,Ftower is welcoming visitors until 13:30
OL,14,FBST on Friday and from 10:00 to 14:00
OL,15,Fon Sunday, as part of this year's
OL,16,FHeritage Open Days.
OL,18,FThe tower, on Beacon Hill north of
OL,19,FSedgley town centre, has been
OL,20,Finaccessible for four decades because
OL,21,Fof the poor condition of its steps.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
