OL,3,GNEWSALandmark open to public for first
OL,4,Atime in 40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough visitors cannot climb the
OL,7,Ftower staircase, they are able to stand
OL,8,Finside and look at recent restoration
OL,9,Fwork, which has included the
OL,10,Freplacement of most of the steps.
